    <description>All the Ship To Accounts on the QuoteLine should be with in the parent Hierarchy except the Strategic Partner.
Logic for Multiple Ship To Account On Quote and QuoteLine- BOPI-567.
BOPI-669 Added Validation Rule ByPass to prevent error when creating the order.
BOPI-841 Updated to fix a bug where the &apos;Multiple_Ship_To_Accounts__c&apos; field was not being populated on amendment quotes.
BOPI-929 , SALDEV-1068 Optimized the flow.
SALDEV-1473 Recalculate Multiple Ship to Accounts from all quote lines on create and update, including inherited ship-to values on child lines used by stepped-up pricing.
SALDEV-1473 Create guard: only run direct Ship-To hierarchy validation when Ship_To_Account__c is populated; blank and inherited lines continue to the quote-wide lookup.</description>
